## Paper2Agent and system capability growth

[[Designs/AI4Research Capability Growth]] is the proposed architecture synthesis. [[Designs/Paper2Agent Capability Factory]] maps the reference into reusable stages and candidate products. [[Designs/Agent Reading and Freshness]] defines focused reading routes, source ownership, and drift handling. These notes do not replace maintained M1 contracts.

**Factory feature route:** [[Designs/Capability Capsule Factory Feature]] is the one-page proposed feature definition; [[Designs/Paper2Agent Capability Factory]] is its detailed stage/source note. Factory-stage CCs, generated product CCs and versioned resources have different identities. Generation never grants admission. Our modified `jiuwenswarm` branch is distinct from original upstream JiuwenSwarm.

**Short presentation pack:** [[Designs/Paper2Agent Briefing/1 Decision brief]] and [[Designs/Paper2Agent Briefing/2 Agent architecture]]. These separate existing conceptual fit from unmeasured integration value, and our modified AI4Research branch from original upstream JiuwenSwarm.

## AI4R lab and CC images

[[Designs/AI4R Lab and CC Images]] records the idea of every CC as a container image, a central image library vendoring to many lab VMs, and lab changes returning as reviewed candidates. It extends [[Designs/cc-containerization-and-lab-isolation]] and leaves the one-CC [[Amendments/Container CC Pilot/README|pilot]] unchanged.

[[Designs/CC as Universal Component]] proposes the CC declaration as the single contract for skills, tools, MCP tools and A2A agents (import and export adapters), and compares the lab loop with the self-improvement goal.

**The talk:** [[Designs/Paper2Agent Briefing/presentation/README|Paper2Agent decision talk]] (deck, script in speaker notes, three figures, claim ledger).

